00:25:40.840 --> 00:25:49.890
 Even without having made it

00:25:45.700 --> 00:25:55.660
Subtitled by:
Central Anime(Kansas)

00:25:51.590 --> 00:26:00.590
What kind of dreams would I accumulate...

00:26:02.240 --> 00:26:11.190
...what kind of love would I go through...

00:26:12.800 --> 00:26:22.990
 ...if I were to reach that light ?

00:26:38.560 --> 00:26:43.560
Preview of Next Episode

00:26:39.350 --> 00:26:42.330
The Battle of Van-Fleet Starzone
finally draws to a conclusion.

00:26:42.330 --> 00:26:45.520
Schenkopp has much that
he lost in this battle...

00:26:45.520 --> 00:26:48.720
...and he increasingly desires a
resolution to his battle with Luneberg.

00:26:49.420 --> 00:26:52.020
On the other hand, Reinhard gets promoted
for his accomplishment on the battlefield...

00:26:52.020 --> 00:26:53.770
...but his frustration still remains.

00:26:53.770 --> 00:26:57.370
Likewise, Luneberg also gets promoted
but still remained unsatisfied.

00:26:58.140 --> 00:26:59.770
Next episode of...

00:26:58.590 --> 00:27:08.560
Legend of the Galactic Heroes Gaiden

00:26:58.590 --> 00:27:08.560
A Hundred Billion Stars,
a Hundred Billion Lights,
Chapter 6
"Chronicle of the Aftermath of the Chaotic War"

00:27:05.160 --> 00:27:07.350
Men's ambitions fly through the galaxy.
